  "notes": "Room 5×5m, H=3m, below the roof. Floor separates from the room below (temperature unknown) — omitted from model. Topology: exterior boundary → R_wall_SE_ext → mur_SE mass → R_wall_SE_int → chambre mass. Roof, insulated walls and windows are parallel paths between chambre and exterior. Solar gains from SE window (SHGC≈0.50 with partial shutter) and NE windows (SHGC≈0.67).\n\nMaterial basis:\n  Roof:          20cm glass wool (λ=0.035), R=5.71 m²K/W → R_roof=0.235 K/W over 25m²\n  Wall SE:       40cm brick pleine (λ=0.8), A=13.5m², 2R1C split at mid-thickness\n                 C_mur_SE = ρ·cp·e·A = 1800×840×0.40×13.5 = 8.16 MJ/K\n  Window SE:     1.0×1.5m, U=2.8 W/m²K → R=0.238 K/W\n  Other walls:   3 sides insulated inside: 20cm brick + 10cm glass wool, A=44.4m²\n  Windows NE:    2×(0.5×0.6m), U=2.8 W/m²K → R=0.595 K/W\n  Air+furniture: 75m³ air × 3 (furniture factor) = 271 kJ/K",

